  "imat-aufbau-filling": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-md rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50/30 p-4 dark:border-indigo-900/60 dark:bg-indigo-950/15\"><p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300\">Animation · filling orbitals: Aufbau, Pauli and Hund</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 214\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Orbital boxes for oxygen filling one electron at a time: two in 1s with opposite spins, two in 2s, then one in each 2p box with parallel spins, then the eighth electron pairs in the first 2p box. Final configuration 1s2 2s2 2p4, two unpaired electrons.\"><g><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"34\" class=\"stroke-muted-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></line><path d=\"M30,40 L34,30 L38,40 Z\" class=\"fill-muted-foreground\"></path><text x=\"22\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 22 120)\" class=\"fill-muted-foreground text-[10px]\">energy</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"160\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"fill-background stroke-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><rect x=\"120\" y=\"104\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"fill-background stroke-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><rect x=\"196\" y=\"56\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"fill-background stroke-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><rect x=\"226\" y=\"56\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"fill-background stroke-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><rect x=\"256\" y=\"56\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"fill-background stroke-foreground\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><text x=\"112\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-foreground text-[11px] font-semibold\">1s</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-foreground text-[11px] font-semibold\">2s</text><text x=\"188\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-foreground text-[11px] font-semibold\">2p</text><text x=\"241\" y=\"97\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"fill-muted-foreground text-[10px]\">three equal 2p orbitals</text><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(129px, 174px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,-3 L0,-10 L5,-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(141px, 174px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,3 L0,10 L5,3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(129px, 118px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,-3 L0,-10 L5,-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(141px, 118px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,3 L0,10 L5,3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(205px, 70px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,-3 L0,-10 L5,-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(235px, 70px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,-3 L0,-10 L5,-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(265px, 70px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,-3 L0,-10 L5,-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><g class=\"text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none\" style=\"transform:translate(217px, 70px) rotate(0deg) scale(1, 1);opacity:1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-10\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M-5,3 L0,10 L5,3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path></g><text x=\"310\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-muted-foreground text-[10px]\">configuration</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-foreground text-[12px] font-semibold\">1s² 2s² 2p⁴</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"fill-muted-foreground text-[10px] tabular-nums\">8 electrons, 2 unpaired</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"fill-foreground text-[12px] font-semibold\">Oxygen, Z = 8: The 8th electron pairs</text></g></svg><ol class=\"mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\" data-step-list=\"\"><li><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">First electron: 1s:</span> Aufbau principle: the first electron goes into the lowest-energy orbital, 1s.</li><li><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">1s full:</span> Pauli: a second electron can share the 1s box only with the opposite spin. Two is the most one orbital holds: 1s².</li><li><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Then 2s:</span> Aufbau again: 1s is full, so the next two electrons go into 2s, the next level up, with opposite spins: 1s² 2s².</li><li><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">One in each 2p box:</span> Hund&#x27;s rule: the next three electrons go one into each 2p orbital, all with parallel spins, before any pair up (1s² 2s² 2p³ is nitrogen).</li><li><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">The 8th electron pairs:</span> No empty 2p box is left, so the 8th electron pairs up with opposite spin. Oxygen: 1s² 2s² 2p⁴, with 2 unpaired electrons.</li></ol><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Each box is one orbital and holds at most two electrons, with opposite spins (up and down arrows).</p></div>",
